# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mica Technologies fork additions
# Everything above this line is inherited from upstream (SuperMartijn642).
# Keep fork-specific entries below so the upstream diff stays readable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Windows / OS cruft
thumbs.db
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# JVM crash logs
hs_err_pid*
crash-reports/
*.log

# Gradle/Java leftovers
tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
local.properties
.factorypath

# Local-only Claude Code state. Shared settings (.claude/settings.json) ARE committed;
# per-machine overrides and agent worktrees are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Agent working notes and implementation plans. Local scratch by design -- these churn
# constantly and are written for whoever/whatever is doing the work right now, not for
# the repo's history. Both spellings are listed because gitignore matching is
# case-sensitive on Linux CI even though macOS checkouts are usually not.
docs/agent-plans/
docs/AGENT-PLANS/

# Secrets. CURSEFORGE_TOKEN / MODRINTH_TOKEN are read from the environment by
# publishMods and must never be committed in any form.
*.env
.env.*
*credentials*
